WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:08.083
<v Narrator>This is a branching adventure test. Audio is fixed, but you choose what to hear next.</v>

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:36.667
<v Narrator>You are confronted with two doors. A silver door on the left and a copper door on the right.</v>

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:04.583
<v Narrator>Choose now. For left, jump to one minute twenty seconds. For right, jump to two minutes twenty seconds.</v>

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:26.667
<v Narrator>You entered the left chamber. The walls contain a code marked seven.</v>

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:55.167
<v Narrator>Your left evidence is the word VIOLET.</v>

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:26.750
<v Narrator>You entered the right chamber. The floor contains a code marked nine.</v>

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:58.917
<v Narrator>For a more ambitious test, follow the description link to an entirely different branch episode.</v>

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:13.000
<v Narrator>End of transmission.</v>
